  "body": "Hi guys,\n\nHere is my attempt to make the spec more readable on mobile devices\n\nI applied some styles suggested here https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/621#issuecomment-179854592 and added more fixes for:\n- the logo\n- blocks (notes, warning, example) from [Typographic conventions](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/introduction.html#typographic-conventions)\n- applying styles to make images [responsive](http://www.w3schools.com/css/css_rwd_images.asp)\n\nThere are still problems that I see and not sure how to fix so far:\n- huge tables don't fit small screens [example](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#dndevents)\n- [Fingerprint icon](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/introduction.html#fingerprinting-vector) covers the text as well as [caniuse table](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/interaction.html#dnd)\n\nPlease let me know what you think\nThank you!\n",
